      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Box breathing helps balance your autonomic nervous system by reducing stress and calming the \"fight or flight\" response. It promotes parasympathetic nervous system activation, producing a state of relaxation. Regular practice lowers cortisol levels by reducing anxiety. It also improves oxygenation in your lungs and brain, enhancing overall body function and mental clarity. Over time, box breathing can improve your stress resilience and emotional well-being.",
      "source": "target",
